---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';

const title = "About me";
const description = "Learn more about the developer behind the keyboard.";
---

<Layout {title} {description} hideNav hideFooter>
  <a href="/" class="btn btn-ghost gap-2 mt-6 rounded-lg">
    <Icon name="heroicons:arrow-left" class="w-4 h-4" />
    Back to home
  </a>

  <section class="max-w-lg mx-auto text-pretty text-xl text-base-content py-20">
    <Image
      src="/media/leandro.webp" 
      alt="Leandro Ubilla's logo" 
      class="w-20 h-20 rounded-lg border border-base-300" 
      width="80" 
      height="80"
      decoding="async"
      loading="lazy"
    />

    <h1 class="mt-6 font-semibold mb-5 text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl leading-none text-balance tracking-tight bg-clip-text">About me</h1>
    
    <p class="mb-6">
      It started in 2008, I built my first website
      in plain HTML and CSS, offering free MySpace templates. Not long after, I launched my first three Flash game sites, their "database" was a <code>.txt</code> file on a friend's server, until I could afford Dreamhost. The designs weren't great, but I was learning, one page at a time.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-6">
      By 2010 I built a network of Flash game sites
      using PHP, MySQL, and HTML. It got real traffic. Then Google Panda hit, and I had to pivot.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-6">
      In 2012 I moved into WordPress and freelancing, building sites and WooCommerce stores with a local studio and later on Fiverr.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-6">
      Later, I picked up Webflow, React, Framer, and UI design. Today, I work with agencies and brands building websites and framer prototypes.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-12">
      <div class="badge py-6 w-[calc(50%-6px)] px-4 rounded-full bg-base-200">
        <Icon class="w-6 h-6" name="heroicons:cursor-arrow-rays-solid" />        
        Framer Prototypes
      </div>
      <div class="badge py-6 w-[calc(50%-6px)] px-4 rounded-full bg-base-200">
        <Icon class="w-6 h-6" name="heroicons:globe-alt-solid" />        
        Webflow
      </div>
      <div class="badge py-6 w-[calc(50%-6px)] px-4 rounded-full bg-base-200">
        <Icon class="w-6 h-6" name="heroicons:globe-alt-solid" />        
        Web Development
      </div>
      <div class="badge py-6 w-[calc(50%-6px)] px-4 rounded-full bg-base-200">
        <Icon class="w-6 h-6" name="heroicons:swatch-solid" />        
        UI Design
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="group flex items-end justify-center mt-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-30 px-2.5">
    <div class="w-1/3 -rotate-6 shadow-xl rounded-2xl overflow-hidden p-3 bg-white translate-x-8 scale-90 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:-translate-x-4">
      <img src="/media/about-1.webp" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg" />
    </div>
    <div class="w-1/3 -translate-y-3 shadow-2xl rounded-2xl overflow-hidden p-3 bg-white z-10">
      <img src="/media/about-2.webp" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg" />
    </div>
    <div class="w-1/3 rotate-6 shadow-xl rounded-2xl overflow-hidden p-3 bg-white -translate-x-8 scale-90 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-4">
      <img src="/media/about-3.webp" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg" />
    </div>
  </div>
  <a href="/" class="btn btn-ghost gap-2 mb-6 rounded-lg">
    <Icon name="heroicons:arrow-left" class="w-4 h-4" />
    Back to home
  </a>
</Layout>